DOCUMENT();

loadMacros(
    'PGstandard.pl',             'PGML.pl',
    'parserRadioMultiAnswer.pl', 'PGcourse.pl'
);

$a = random(1, 8);

$rma =
    RadioMultiAnswer([ ['The limit does not exist'], [ 'The limit is %s', 0 ] ],
        0);

BEGIN_PGML
Evaluate the limit
[``` \lim_{ x \rightarrow [$a] } \frac{|x - [$a]|}{x - [$a]}```]

[_]{$rma}
END_PGML

$ans = "DNE";
# ANS(num_cmp($ans, strings=>["DNE"]));

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION

Let [`f(x) = \frac{|x-[$a]|}{x-[$a]}`].

[`f(x) =\begin{cases}
         \frac{-(x-[$a])}{x-[$a]} &  x < [$a]\\
         \frac{x-[$a]}{x-[$a]} & x > [$a]\\
       \end{cases} `]

[`f(x) =\begin{cases}
         -1 &  x < [$a]\\
         1 & x > [$a]\\
       \end{cases}`]
       
From this it should be clear that [` \displaystyle \lim_{ x \rightarrow [$a] } \frac{|x - [$a]|}{x - [$a]} `] does not exist.
END_PGML_SOLUTION

